  + ///
  + /// | field | direction | decision |
  + /// |---|---|---|
  + /// | `[permissions] allow` | **grants** privilege (auto-approves bash commands) | refused when project-local and untrusted |
  + /// | `[permissions] deny` | reduces privilege (always blocks) | kept verbatim |
